This LICENSE covers the 8frame builds in this directory:
  8frame-1.1.0.min.js, 8frame-1.3.0.min.js, 8frame-1.4.1.min.js, 8frame-1.5.0.min.js

8frame is A-Frame (https://github.com/aframevr/aframe) with small patches by
8th Wall applied (e.g. a-scene waits for window.XR8 / "xrloaded" before play,
and registers XR8.AFrame.xrwebComponent() as "xrweb"). The A-Frame portion is
licensed under the A-Frame MIT License (part 1). The 8th Wall patches carry no
separate license notice in the distributed files; they are treated the same as
the rest of the open source 8th Wall packages (github.com/8thwall/8thwall,
e.g. packages/xrextras), i.e. under the MIT License with the Niantic Spatial,
Inc. copyright notice (part 2).

The other files in this directory (aframe-extras, aframe-physics-system,
stats.js) are separate projects; see lib/vendor/LICENSES.md.

